    <node id="&quot;JAMES REED&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"James Reed is a leading expert in historical correspondence and provides insight into the relationship between Marion Jessie Thompson and Ruby Frewen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0190</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE MARRIAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Marriage of Marion Jessie Thompson and Ruby Frewen is a significant event that has garnered public attention and sparked debate about its legitimacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0190</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public refers to the general population that is fascinated by the enigmatic couple and their marriage."</data>
