    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGITIMACY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legitimacy is a concept that has been questioned regarding the marriage of Marion Jessie Thompson and Ruby Frewen."</data>
